WEBVTT

00:14:59.985 --> 00:15:03.599
No necessitaves el meu judici &lt;br /&gt;ni el meu menyspreu.

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:08.128
"&gt;Necessitaves la meva empatia i compassió,

00:15:08.728 --> 00:15:10.723
i per damunt de tot, necessitaves un metge

00:15:10.723 --> 00:15:12.813
disposat a considerar

00:15:13.352 --> 00:15:16.416
que potser no havies fallat al sistema.

00:15:16.416 --> 00:15:19.634
Potser el sistema, que m'incloïa,

00:15:19.634 --> 00:15:22.073
t'estava fallant a tu.

00:15:22.073 --> 00:15:24.874
Si ara em veus,

00:15:24.874 --> 00:15:27.942
espero que em puguis perdonar.

00:15:29.112 --> 00:15:33.112
(Aplaudiments)